07","text":"秦王既沒，餘威振於殊俗。陳涉，罋牖繩樞之子，甿隸之人，而遷徙之徒，才能不及中人，非有仲尼、墨翟之賢，陶朱、猗頓之富，躡足行伍之閒，而倔起什伯之中，率罷散之卒，將數百之眾，而轉攻秦。斬木為兵，揭竿為旗，天下雲集響應，贏糧而景從，山東豪俊遂并起而亡秦族矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"pom_ycp_ha5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"j5s_4zz_bos","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"墨翟","kind":"person","person_id":"tjx_q6x_kc7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"陶朱","kind":"person","person_id":"dko_o9v_cf7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"猗頓","kind":"person","person_id":"kxz_6nu_h9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block07:m0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"秦族","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、群體或未核指代，不據引文譬喻補造個人。"}],"source_block_kind":"witness_dd","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-006","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang","source":{"title":"史記／卷006","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷006","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷006&oldid=7907969","revision_id":7907969,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"數位見證127個文字區塊，含16個dd刻辭或嵌入引文及卷末附載班固記；排除導覽、跨站連結與註號。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文與附載文字；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名